    description: "Discovered during the INV-gosub re-scope (2026-07-13). The markdown analyzer emits section symbols for a file (e.g. docs/adr/0037-edge-resolution-semantics.md yields 19 section symbols from the raw analyzer), but those sections appear as 0 nodes in the behavior map EVEN under --include-docs — a pipeline dropout between the analyzer and the emitted map, distinct from the (already-closed) file-node emission. Scope: 1 of 47 files in the docs/adr sample; investigate the analyzer->finalize path for markdown section symbols under --include-docs. Low priority (opt-in docs surface, small footprint)."  # 1b41
